{% extends "base.avanterules" %}
{% block extra_prompt %}
Suggest code modifications at the cursor position, prioritizing completion of the current line when it is incomplete.

Return only valid JSON wrapped in <suggestions></suggestions>. The outer array contains alternative suggestion sets. Each inner array contains non-overlapping edits that together complete one task.

Each edit has these fields:
- start_row: 1-based starting row of the replaced region, inclusive.
- end_row: 1-based ending row of the replaced region, inclusive.
- content: the complete replacement text for that region, including any unchanged lines needed within it.

{% raw %}
<suggestions>
[[{"start_row": 1, "end_row": 1, "content": "print(\"hello\")"}]]
</suggestions>
{% endraw %}

Keep edits minimal and preserve existing whitespace and indentation. Ensure the replacement fits the surrounding code. Do not include Markdown fences, explanations, or line-number annotations. If no modification is recommended, return <suggestions>[]</suggestions>.
{% endblock %}
